{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46929","headline":"怀武陵因寄幕中韩先辈何从事 · 齐己","name":"怀武陵因寄幕中韩先辈何从事","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"武陵嘉致迹多幽，每见图经恨白头。\n溪浪碧通何处去，桃花红过郡前流。\n常闻相幕鸳鸿兴，日向神仙洞府游。\n凿井耕田人在否，如今天子正徵搜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46929.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46929","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}